<title>USA: M.A. Hanna raises stock buyback, qtly div.</title>
<headline>M.A. Hanna raises stock buyback, qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>M.A. Hanna Co said Wednesday that it is raising its quarterly dividend to $0.105 per share of common stock, up from $0.10.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable December 12 to shareholders of record November 27.</p>
<p>The company said also that its board increased its share repurchase program to 2.5 million shares, representing about 5 percent of the company's outstanding shares.</p>
</text>
